<card id="c" title="What&apos;s on My Raspberry Pi 5">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>&#160;&#160;- <a href="https://github.com/gthrm/air-quality-monitoring-bot">Air Quality Monitoring Bot</a> - a bot that notifies about increased temperature or air pollution in the apartment based on <a href="https://thingspeak.com/">ThingSpeak</a> and <a href="https://www.nodemcu.com/index_en.html">nodemcu</a>.</p>
<p><b>Self-hosted Solutions</b></p>
<p>- <a href="https://docs.n8n.io/hosting/">n8n</a> <i>(<a href="https://n8n.io/workflows/2327-host-your-own-uptime-monitoring-with-scheduled-triggers/">for example, a flow for monitoring resource availability</a>)</i>;</p>
<p>- <a href="https://www.jenkins.io/download/">Jenkins</a>;</p>
<p>- <a href="https://www.docker.com/blog/how-to-use-the-postgres-docker-official-image/">Postgres</a>;</p>
<p>- <a href="https://clickhouse.com/docs/en/install">ClickHouse</a>.</p>
